senses.gloss:
क्रीत + .{@-तः@} One of the twelve kinds of sons recognised in Hindu Law;
 a son purchased from his natural parents; Ms. 9. 160; क्रीतश्च ताभ्यां
 विक्रीतः Y. 2. 131; तव क्रीतसुतोऽस्मीति वाचिकेन व्यजिज्ञपत् Śiva B. 31. 32.

क्रीड + .{@-डः@}
—1 Sport, pastime, play, pleasure.
—2 Jest, joke.
